{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22354","headline":"留别 · 白居易","name":"留别","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"秋凉卷朝簟，春暖撤夜衾。\n虽是无情物，欲别尚沈吟。\n况与有情别，别随情浅深。\n二年欢笑意，一旦东西心。\n独留诚可念，同行力不任。\n前事讵能料，後期谅难寻。\n唯有潺湲泪，不惜共沾襟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22354.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22354","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}